# What `make fixtures` reads from a device, one source per line:
#   file PATH           the file, or every file the glob matches (unreadable ones are skipped)
#   ubus OBJECT METHOD [ARGS]   the reply, saved as ubus/OBJECT.METHOD.json
file /proc/loadavg
ubus system board
ubus dnsmasq metrics
ubus wireguard status
ubus mwan3 status {"section":"interfaces"}
